<CustomMetadata xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
    <label>Account gifts last year</label>
    <protected>true</protected>
    <values>
        <field>Description__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >How many gifts this organization or person account gave in the previous fiscal year, counted rather than added, so that a gift refunded later still counts as one gift. The fiscal year runs from the fiscal year start month in Nonprofit Settings, and a gift falls in it by its gift date. Retention reporting reads this to tell a retained donor from a reactivated one.</value>
    </values>
